msgid ""
"Events sent to the webhook, queued deliveries of removed events are cancelled"
msgstr ""
"Gebeurtenisse wat na die webhook gestuur word; aflewerings in die waglys vir "
"verwyderde gebeurtenisse word gekanselleer"

msgctxt "webhooks"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Naam"

msgctxt "webhooks"
msgid ""
"Optional name to tell webhooks with the same endpoint apart, visible to all "
"webhook editors"
msgstr ""
"Opsionele naam om webhooks met dieselfde eindpunt te onderskei; sigbaar vir "
"almal wat webhooks kan wysig"

